## 2026-11-27 — Phase 18, Part 2: the four-storey Spire

- Picked up after the Marsh, Quarry, and Snowfield playtests. The existing
  facility generator was still limited to two storeys.
- Added `src/facility-kinds.ts` and `src/server/spire-layout.ts`. Each expedition
  draws its facility independently of its outdoor map. The abandoned factory
  uses its existing two-storey generator. The Spire has one fixed room layout
  with three flights that turn around its core, rooms off all four floors, and
  an inner stairwell connecting the second-floor lockers to the third-floor
  chiller. Salvage varies with the seed. The Spire's fire exits lead to rooms
  on the ground floor.
- Added the tower façade and collision, upstairs and downstairs doorway signs,
  and a four-floor view in diagnostics. `npm run dev` and `?solo=1&layout=spire`
  start the seed 1 contract at the Spire. Use seed 19 to start at the factory.
