  their layout version and reject older saves before loading old player
  positions into a newly drawn facility. Solo already checked the version.
- Game Hub commit `7e4d05f` updates `tests/browser/relay-room.spec.js` for version
  10 and checks the seeded facility choice at admission and on the next
  expedition. Relay Room stays at `/relay-room/` with solo and two-player co-op.

