## 2026-11-28 — Open-shaft Spire revision

- Playtesters wanted a distinct tower with a spiral and a central drop. Used
  their local `media/spire_blueprint.png` as reference and ignored `/media/`.
- Replaced the box stair flights with a helix, a shared shaft, circular steel
  treads, and doorways to the wings. Stacked flights share a visibility link.
  Movement, routing, falls, and throws use the same curved surfaces. The void
  below the base uses the pit death rule and fades into black. Added a stepped
  circular exterior with round collision and cardinal doors.
- Generator version 11 retains four levels and the east-wing shortcut between
  floors two and three. The seed varies the room types and some corridor
  lengths. Stores, closets, lockers, cold stores, workshops, and the new
  Hoist supply rooms and Survey stations can recur. One Foreman's office
  appears at the base. The factory still uses its existing generator.
- The wings have zero, one, two, and three suspended pit rooms from bottom to
  top. New Counterweight chambers and Broken transfer galleries share the
  factory pits' fog and fall handling. Their salvage is across the crossing.
  Transfer galleries have a route via jumps and a walkable route on a ledge.
- Game Hub compares the admitted layout version to the game source. Existing
  version 10 checkpoints follow the established version checks.

